{"id":3383,"path":"/grammar-points/a2/so-neither/","parentId":542,"order":250,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"So, neither: So am I, neither do I, etc.","seo":{"title":"So, neither: So am I, neither do I, etc. - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use 'so' and 'neither' in this A2 Pre-intermediate grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A2-so-neither.png"},"modified":"2026-02-25T08:08:35","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct forms with <em>so, neither, too, either</em> to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"408\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct forms with <em>so, neither, too, either</em> to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"409\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences using&nbsp;<em>so, neither&nbsp;</em>and the words in brackets with the correct auxiliary.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: ‘Michael didn’t play very well’ ‘<span class=\"textGap\">Neither did James</span>. (James)</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"410\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2>So and neither: So am I, neither do I, etc.</h2> <h3><strong>So-too, neither-either</strong> – Grammar charts</h3> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21262\" src=\"/media/uploads/so-neither_so-too_new.png\" alt=\"So do I – so, neither\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21261\" src=\"/media/uploads/so-neither_neither-either_new.png\" alt=\"Neither do I – so, neither\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4>A is or does the same as B</h4> <p>To say that A is or does the same as B, we can use&nbsp;<strong>so</strong> + <a href=\"/grammar-points/a2/auxiliary-verbs-do-be-and-have/\"><strong>auxiliary verb</strong></a> + <strong>subject</strong> in affirmative sentences and&nbsp;<strong>neither + auxiliary verb + subject</strong> in negative sentences.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li>A: <em>“I am from London.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“<span><strong>So</strong></span> am I.” </em>(=I am from London too.)</li> <li>A: <em>“I’m not tired.”</em> &nbsp;B: <em>“<strong><span>Neither</span></strong> am I.”</em> (=I am not tired either.)</li> </ul> <h4>What auxiliary verb do we need?</h4> <p>After <strong>so</strong>/<strong>neither</strong>, we use the same auxiliary or modal verb as in the first sentence:&nbsp;<strong>be, do, have, </strong><a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/can-cant/\"><strong>can</strong></a>, <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/will-and-shall/\"><strong>will</strong></a>, <a href=\"/grammar-points/a2/have-to-dont-have-to-must-mustnt/\">must</a><strong>, etc.</strong></p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li>A: <em>“Tomas <span><strong>is</strong></span> not going to the party.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“<span>Neither</span> <span><strong>is</strong></span> Sally.” </em></li> <li>A: <em>“I’<strong><span>ll</span> </strong>be here at 7.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“So <span><strong>will</strong></span> I.” </em></li> <li>A: <em>“Lisa <span><strong>can</strong></span>&nbsp;play the guitar.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“So&nbsp;<span><strong>can</strong></span> Tim.”</em></li> </ul> <p>When there isn’t an auxiliary or modal verb in the first sentence, we use&nbsp;<strong>do/does</strong> in the present and&nbsp;<strong>did</strong> in the past.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li>A: <em>“I want to leave.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“So <span><strong>do</strong></span> I.”</em></li> <li>A: <em>“George loves chocolate.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“So <span><strong>does</strong></span> Bruno.”</em></li> <li>A: <em>“I went to bed very late.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“So <span><strong>did</strong></span> I.”</em></li> </ul> <h4>Nor = neither</h4> <p>We can use&nbsp;<strong>nor</strong> instead of <strong>neither</strong>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li>A: <em>“I wasn’t ready.”</em> &nbsp;B: <em>“<span><strong>Nor/Neither</strong></span> was I.”</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Neither</strong> is negative</h4> <p><strong>Neither/nor</strong> is a negative word, like <strong>not</strong>. For this reason, the auxiliary verb after&nbsp;<strong>neither&nbsp;</strong>should be affirmative.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li>A: <em>“I didn’t see the film yesterday.”</em> &nbsp;B: <em>“Neither <span><strong>didn’t</strong></span> I.” <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li>A: <em>“I didn’t see the film yesterday.”</em> &nbsp;B: <em>“Neither <span><strong>did</strong></span> I.” <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li>A: <em>“Ray couldn’t answer the question.”</em> &nbsp;B: <em>“Neither <span><strong>couldn’t</strong></span> Jimmy.” <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li>A: <em>“Ray couldn’t answer the question.”</em> &nbsp;B: <em>“Neither <span><strong>could</strong></span> Jimmy.” <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> </ul> <h2>Too, either</h2> <p>Another way of saying that A is or does the same as B, is the use of&nbsp;<strong>too</strong> or&nbsp;<strong>either</strong> at the end of the sentence. We use&nbsp;<strong>too</strong> for affirmative sentences and&nbsp;<strong>either</strong> for negative sentences.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li>A: <em>“I want to leave.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“I want to leave <span><strong>too</strong></span>.”</em></li> <li>A: <em>“I didn’t go.” </em>&nbsp;B: <em>“I didn’t go <span><strong>either</strong></span>.”</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":408,"questions":[{"id":3492,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I haven't written the essay yet.' &nbsp;B: 'Neither <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["haven't","do","have"]}]},{"id":3499,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I'm very thirsty.' &nbsp;B: '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["So am I","Too I am","So do I"]}]},{"id":3498,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'Sam won't help us.' &nbsp;B: 'Neither <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["won't Scotty","will Scotty","does Scotty"]}]},{"id":3500,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I can't forgive them for what happened.' &nbsp;B: 'I can't forgive them <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["neither","either","too"]}]},{"id":3501,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I drink too much coffee.' &nbsp;B: '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["So do I","Neither do I","So am I"]}]},{"id":3502,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'Mum was very proud of us.' &nbsp;B: 'And <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["so dad was","too was dad","so was dad"]}]},{"id":3503,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Ann will be there and so <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["her sister will","will her sister","is her sister"]}]},{"id":3504,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'You didn't tell the truth.' &nbsp;B: 'Nor <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["didn't you","you did","did you"]}]},{"id":3505,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I watched the match in a pub.' &nbsp;B: 'So <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["I did","did I","was I"]}]},{"id":3506,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I would really like to go.' &nbsp;B: '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["So did I","Neither would I","So would I"]}]}]},{"id":409,"questions":[{"id":3493,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'I can't go to the presentation.' B: '_____ .'</div>","choices":[{"id":5649,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Neither can't I </span>"},{"id":5650,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Neither can I </span>"},{"id":5651,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>So can I</span>"}]},{"id":3508,"num":"2","type":"checkbox","prompt":"<div>A: 'I'm not going out tonight.' &nbsp; &nbsp;B: '_____.' &nbsp; <span class=\"highlighter\">Choose TWO correct answers</span></div>","maxSelections":2,"choices":[{"id":5667,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Neither I am</span>"},{"id":5668,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Neither am I</span>"},{"id":5669,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>I am either</span>"},{"id":5670,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>I'm not going out either</span>"}]},{"id":3494,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'I haven't got time.' &nbsp;B: 'Neither _____.'</div>","choices":[{"id":5652,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>have I</span>"},{"id":5653,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>I have</span>"},{"id":5654,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>do I</span>"}]},{"id":3495,"num":"4","type":"checkbox","prompt":"<div>A: ‘I went for a run this morning.’ B: ‘_____ .’ <span class=\"highlighter\">Choose TWO correct answers</span></div>","maxSelections":2,"choices":[{"id":5655,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>So did I</span>"},{"id":5656,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>So am I</span>"},{"id":5657,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>So was I </span>"},{"id":5682,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>I went for a run too</span>"}]},{"id":3496,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'I never go to the cinema.' &nbsp;B: '______.'</div>","choices":[{"id":5658,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Neither do I</span>"},{"id":5659,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Neither am I</span>"},{"id":5660,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>So am I</span>"}]},{"id":3497,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'Sophia isn't coming with us.' &nbsp;B: 'And _____.'</div>","choices":[{"id":5661,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>so isn't Emily</span>"},{"id":5662,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>neither is Emily</span>"},{"id":5663,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>either isn't Emily</span>"}]},{"id":3507,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'I want some pizza.' &nbsp;B: '_____.'</div>","choices":[{"id":5664,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>So do I</span>"},{"id":5665,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Neither do I</span>"},{"id":5666,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>So I do</span>"}]},{"id":3509,"num":"8","type":"checkbox","prompt":"<div>A: 'I wasn't scared.' B: '_____.' <span class=\"highlighter\">Choose TWO correct answers</span></div>","maxSelections":2,"choices":[{"id":5671,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Neither was I</span>"},{"id":5672,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Neither wasn't I</span>"},{"id":5673,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>I was scared either</span>"},{"id":5674,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>I wasn't scared either</span>"}]},{"id":3510,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'I thought it was difficult.' &nbsp;B: '_____.'</div>","choices":[{"id":5675,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Neither did I </span>"},{"id":5676,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>So I did</span>"},{"id":5677,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>So did I </span>"}]},{"id":3511,"num":"10","type":"checkbox","prompt":"<div>A: 'I didn't enjoy the concert.' &nbsp;B: '_____.' <span class=\"highlighter\">Choose TWO correct answers</span></div>","maxSelections":2,"choices":[{"id":5678,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>So didn't I </span>"},{"id":5679,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Neither didn't I</span>"},{"id":5680,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Neither did I</span>"},{"id":5681,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>I didn't enjoy it either. </span>"}]}]},{"id":410,"questions":[{"id":3512,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'My phone doesn't work very well.' '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (mine).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3513,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'Emily has passed the exam.' '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (Victor).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3514,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'I live in the city center.' '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (my parents).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3515,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'We went camping last summer.' '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (we).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3516,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'Sofia wasn't very inspired by the teacher.' &nbsp;'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (Nic).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3517,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>James didn't say \"hello\" when he saw us and <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (Daniel).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3518,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'I'm working this weekend.' '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (I).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3519,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Ellen should apologise and <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (you).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3520,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I won't accept your apology and <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (my wife).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3521,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'I'm not really worried.' '<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (I).'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}